<title>MALAYSIA: Petronas Dagangan 6-mth net down 8.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Petronas Dagangan 6-mth net down 8.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  80.06   vs	  87.31</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 20.5    vs	  22.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,873.99   vs     1,688.58</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   118.27   vs	 122.48</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	   5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is Petronas Dagangan Bhd. The company is involved in the domestic marketing of petroleum products and operating service stations.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
